@startuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "Registered User" as User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "User Service" as US
database "User DB" as DB

User -> App : Navigates to "Statistics"
activate App

App -> Gateway : GET /api/v1/users/{userId}/stats
activate Gateway

note right of Gateway
  Gateway verifies JWT signature
  to ensure privacy
end note

Gateway -> US : Forward Request
activate US

US -> DB : SELECT total_distance, avg_speed, trips_count\nFROM UserStats WHERE user_id = ?
activate DB
DB --> US : Result Set
deactivate DB

US --> Gateway : 200 OK\n{"totalKm": ..., "avgSpeed": ..., "trips": ...}
deactivate US

Gateway --> App : Return JSON
deactivate Gateway

App -> App : Render Charts
App --> User : Display Statistics
deactivate App

@enduml